, "docpuburl": "http://www.ya.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/bmzfxxgkml/qxjzyfjjshjzdkwdglsyhfpqk/201910/t20191016_1341893.htm", "docreltime": "2019.07.09 17:17:00", "doctitle": "永安市民政局　永安市财政局关于提高城乡居民最低生活保障和特困人员供养标准的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "永民〔2019〕52号", "idxid": "SM03109-3000-2019-00038", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2019.07.03 00:00:00", "puborg": "永安市民政局", "recid": 1424380, "sourcename": "永安市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.ya.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/bmzfxxgkml/qxjzyfjjshjzdkwdglsyhfpqk/201910/t20191016_1341893.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.ya.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/bmzfxxgkml/qxjzyfjjshjzdkwdglsyhfpqk/201910/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1313162, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "低保、特困人员救助", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shjz/dbtkryzz/201907/t20190703_1313162.htm", "content": "\n　　为提升我市社会救助兜底保障水平，助力脱贫攻坚，7月1日，我市出台《关于提高城乡居民最低生活保障和特困人员供养标准的通知》，进一步提高城乡居民最低生活保障和特困人员标准。\n　　城乡低保标准按照当地最低", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2019.07.03 17:24:00", "doctitle": "2019年我市城乡居民最低生活保障和特困人员供养标准", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1384831, "sourcename": "三明市民政局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1273093, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "低保、特困人员救助", "chnldocurl": "http://www.ya.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/bmzfxxgkml/qxjzyfjjshjzdkwdglsyhfpqk/201903/t20190315_1273093.htm", "content": "\n\n各乡镇（街道）民政办：\n　　为增强低保制度托底功能，做好支出型贫困家庭保障工作，现将福建省民政厅《关于进一步做好支出型贫困家庭最低生活保障工作的通知》（闽民保〔2018〕211号）转发给你们，请认真组织实施", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.ya.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/bmzfxxgkml/qxjzyfjjshjzdkwdglsyhfpqk/201903/t20190315_1273093.htm", "docreltime": "2019.02.13 09:24:00", "doctitle": "永安市民政局转发福建省民政厅关于进一步做好支出型贫困家庭最低生活保障工作的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "永民〔2019〕6号", "idxid": "SM03109-3000-2019-00012", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2019.01.25 00:00:00", "puborg": "永安市民政局", "recid": 1625014, "sourcename": "永安市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.ya.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/bmzfxxgkml/qxjzyfjjshjzdkwdglsyhfpqk/201903/t20190315_1273093.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.ya.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/bmzfxxgkml/qxjzyfjjshjzdkwdglsyhfpqk/201903/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1269862, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "低保、特困人员救助", "chnldocurl": "http://www.ya.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/bmzfxxgkml/qtyzdgkdzfxx_14746/201903/t20190304_1269862.htm", "content": "\n\n各乡镇人民政府、街道办事处： \n　　为贯彻落实《福建省人力资源和社会保障厅 福建省财政厅 福建省扶贫开发领导小组办公室关于完善城乡居民养老保险扶贫代缴政策的通知》(闽人社文〔2018〕294号)、《福建省人力", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.ya.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/bmzfxxgkml/qtyzdgkdzfxx_14746/201903/t20190304_1269862.htm", "docreltime": "2019.01.17 10:06:00", "doctitle": "永安市人力资源和社会保障局 永安市财政局 永安市民政局 永安市扶贫开发领导小组办公室关于进一步完善城乡居民养老保险扶贫代缴政策的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "永人社〔2019〕6 号", "idxid": "SM03113-1000-2019-00011", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2019.01.17 00:00:00", "puborg": "永安市人力资源和社会保障局", "recid": 1625015, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.ya.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/bmzfxxgkml/qtyzdgkdzfxx_14746/201903/t20190304_1269862.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.ya.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/bmzfxxgkml/qtyzdgkdzfxx_14746/201903/", "rels": []}]}